{"id":"106a7e04ae668c35","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-hardcore-distribution.md","title":"Impagliazzo 硬核分布引理","display":"lem-hardcore-distribution — Impagliazzo 硬核分布引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-hardcore-distribution","aliases":["28-lem-hardcore-distribution"],"display":"lem-hardcore-distribution — Impagliazzo 硬核分布引理","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma 19.3; circuit model Definition 6.1","source_printed_pages":"107,376–378","source_pdf_pages":"133,402–404","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-hardcore-distribution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-hardcore-distribution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-hardcore-distribution — Impagliazzo 硬核分布引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma 19.3; circuit model Definition 6.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"107,376–378"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"133,402–404"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\delta&lt;1\">\\(0&lt;\\delta&lt;1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\epsilon&lt;1/2\">\\(0&lt;\\epsilon&lt;1/2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(S\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_C\">\\(\\operatorname{out}_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}_C\">\\(\\operatorname{pred}_C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a>；电路 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(V_C,E_C,\\vec\\imath_C,\\vec o_C,\\tau_C)\">\\(C=(V_C,E_C,\\vec\\imath_C,\\vec o_C,\\tau_C)\\)</span> 的标签使用该定义中的互异标识；令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_\\land=\\mathsf{and}\">\\(\\alpha_\\land=\\mathsf{and}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_\\lor=\\mathsf{or}\">\\(\\alpha_\\lor=\\mathsf{or}\\)</span> 为该来源的两个门标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_n(s),\\mathcal D_n\">\\(\\mathcal C_n(s),\\mathcal D_n\\)</span> 是下式引入的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_n(s)\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}:n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\\le s\\land\\forall v\\in V_C\\;[\\tau_C(v)\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\land(\\tau_C(v)\\in\\{\\alpha_\\land,\\alpha_\\lor\\}\\Rightarrow|\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)|=2)\\land((\\neg\\exists w\\in V_C\\;(v,w)\\in E_C)\\Longleftrightarrow v=(\\vec o_C)_1)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_n(s)\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}:n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\\le s\\land\\forall v\\in V_C\\;[\\tau_C(v)\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\land(\\tau_C(v)\\in\\{\\alpha_\\land,\\alpha_\\lor\\}\\Rightarrow|\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)|=2)\\land((\\neg\\exists w\\in V_C\\;(v,w)\\in E_C)\\Longleftrightarrow v=(\\vec o_C)_1)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_n\\coloneqq\\{H:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to[0,1]:\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}H(x)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal D_n\\coloneqq\\{H:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to[0,1]:\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}H(x)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}[\\forall C\\in\\mathcal C_n(S)\\;2^{-n}|\\{x:\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1=f(x)\\}|&lt;1-\\delta]\\Longrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal D_n\\quad[&amp;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;H(x)\\le\\frac1{\\delta2^n}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathcal C_n(\\lfloor\\epsilon^2S/(100n)\\rfloor)\\;\\sum_{x:\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1=f(x)}H(x)\\le\\frac12+\\epsilon].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}[\\forall C\\in\\mathcal C_n(S)\\;2^{-n}|\\{x:\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1=f(x)\\}|&lt;1-\\delta]\\Longrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal D_n\\quad[&amp;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;H(x)\\le\\frac1{\\delta2^n}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathcal C_n(\\lfloor\\epsilon^2S/(100n)\\rfloor)\\;\\sum_{x:\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1=f(x)}H(x)\\le\\frac12+\\epsilon].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用原书输入节点计入大小的原模型：全部节点构成有限无环图，恰有 n 个输入源，AND/OR 恰二扇入、NOT 恰一扇入，没有常量输入，且所选输出是唯一 sink。有限 DAG 的每个节点沿出边最终到达某个 sink，故唯一 sink 条件也保证所有节点通向输出。避免把本目录常量门与至多二扇入模型的定量常数直接移植。密度 δ 指最大点质量界，允许非平坦分布。已核对引理的量词和系数；原书用极小极大与抽样反证，本次不宣称已完整核验该证明。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma 19.3；印刷页 376–378；PDF 页 402–404。电路模型另核对 Definition 6.1；印刷页 107；PDF 页 133。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$0<\\delta<1$，$0<\\epsilon<1/2$，$S\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}$、$\\operatorname{out}_C$、$\\operatorname{pred}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]，$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]；电路 $C=(V_C,E_C,\\vec\\imath_C,\\vec o_C,\\tau_C)$ 的标签使用该定义中的互异标识；令 $\\alpha_\\land=\\mathsf{and}$、$\\alpha_\\lor=\\mathsf{or}$ 为该来源的两个门标签。$\\mathcal C_n(s),\\mathcal D_n$ 是下式引入的集合，$s\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600